	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r1001_man3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ユーは　テレビで　なにが　すき？
ミーは　おねえさんと　ミルホッくん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T04:38:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ユーは　テレビで　なにが　好き？
ミーは　お姉さんと　ミルホッくん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T04:38:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
